OL,3,ANew Inbetweeners film confirmed by
OL,4,ANetflix as lead stars return
OL,5,
OL,6,FOoh, sequel friend! A new Inbetweeners
OL,7,Fmovie is officially in the works,
OL,8,FNetflix has confirmed.
OL,10,FThe original cast of Simon Bird, James
OL,11,FBuckley, Blake Harrison and Joe Thomas
OL,12,Fwill reprise their roles for the
OL,13,Ffeature film, with production starting
OL,14,Fon Monday.
OL,16,FThe Inbetweeners 3 will follow on the
OL,17,Fstory of their characters, Will
OL,18,FMcKenzie, Jay Cartwright, Neil
OL,19,FSutherland and Simon Cooper.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
